WEBVTT

1
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:17,410
I want to trust you

2
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:20,410
Come out and I'll cut off your hands

3
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:21,410
Cut off your legs

4
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:54,140
I really want to see the desperate expressions of those people. What a pity.

5
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:57,180
They should now be beaten by their teammates

6
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:59,180
Just tear it apart.
